Package: TranscriptMetaAnalyst
Title: TranscriptMetaAnalyst (TMA): A graphical user interface to meta-analyze RNA-Seq transcriptomics data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Eslam", "Abdel-Salam", email = "eabdelsalam@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This app is designed to help biologists with less programming skills to perform meta-analysis of several transcriptomic RNA-Seq-generated data sets in order to get robust results and new insights into the data that was generated by their own studies or the data available online.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
